        <div class="alert">
            
				<div class="alertImg"><img src="images/alert.png" alt="Alert" title="Alert" align="left" /></div>
                <div class="alertText">
					<p>We're sorry, but we're having trouble opening this document because we did not recognize your session variable. This may have been caused by:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Using a bookmark to access a specific part of this site. <em>Not all pages in this site can be bookmarked. </em></li>
						<li>Your internet session timing-out.  Please click in the top header to return to the homepage and then navigate back to the desired page.</li>
					</ul>
					<p>If you continue having trouble, please use the "Contact Us" link in the top navigation bar and include the name of the document you were trying to access and the Error Code below.<br/><br/>Thank you and our apologies for the inconvenience.
					</p>
                    <p style="color:#b30000;">Error Code: 
					
							[EC09]
						</p>
				</div>
            
